<html lang='zh-TW'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>重置密碼</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', 'PingFang TC', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f9; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
      .header { background-color: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; }
      .header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
      .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
      .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .button { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background-color: #2b6cb0; color: white !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; margin: 20px 0; }
      .info { background-color: #ebf4ff; border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; }
      .warning { background-color: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #d69e2e; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
      .warning ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
      .warning li { margin: 4px 0; }
      .url-box { word-break: break-all; background-color: #f7f8fa; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; color: #555; }
      .footer { background-color: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf1; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2>🔐 重置您的密碼</h2>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>您好，{{name}}！</p>

        <p>我們收到了重置您帳號密碼的請求。如果這是您本人的操作，請點擊下方按鈕來設定新密碼：</p>

        <p style='text-align: center;'>
          <a href='{{url}}' style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background-color: #2b6cb0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;'>重置密碼</a>
        </p>

        <div class='warning'>
          <strong>⚠️ 重要提示：</strong>
          <ul>
            <li>此連結將在 <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong> 後失效</li>
            <li>此連結只能使用一次</li>
            <li>如果不是您本人操作，請忽略此郵件</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p>如果按鈕無法點擊，請複製以下連結到瀏覽器：</p>
        <p class='url-box'>{{url}}</p>

        <div class='info'>
          <strong>🛡️ 安全資訊：</strong><br />
          請求來源 IP：{{ipAddress}}<br />
          請求時間：{{timestamp}}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>如果您沒有請求重置密碼，請立即聯繫我們的客服團隊。</p>
        <p>此郵件由系統自動發送，請勿直接回覆。</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 加雲聯網 Intelligent Cloud Plus, Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
